WEBVTT

01:40.600 --> 01:44.420
ROUTE K1, SMOOTH TRAVELS WITH HONGYANG BUS

02:09.400 --> 02:10.580
Qin Yeyun!

02:20.600 --> 02:21.560
Qin Yeyun!

02:22.060 --> 02:24.520
What are you yelling for?
You're embarrassing me, Lin Yingtao.

02:24.560 --> 02:25.660
It really is you!

02:35.260 --> 02:36.220
I didn't recognize you

02:36.260 --> 02:37.820
at first from across the way.

02:37.860 --> 02:39.160
I didn't recognize you either.

02:39.200 --> 02:40.160
You've changed a lot.

02:41.140 --> 02:42.020
Let's go.

02:42.900 --> 02:44.220
STUDENT CAFETERIA

02:44.260 --> 02:45.260
I'll put this down.

02:51.260 --> 02:52.800
Your university's cafeteria food

02:52.840 --> 02:53.680
is somehow even worse

02:53.720 --> 02:54.740
than our old cafeteria.

02:54.780 --> 02:55.860
So salty. How do you eat this?

02:57.540 --> 02:58.880
I'm used to it.

02:58.920 --> 03:00.320
It's not just our cafeteria.

03:00.360 --> 03:01.740
Everything in Hongyang is salty.

03:03.300 --> 03:05.160
When I first moved here,
my senior told me,

03:05.660 --> 03:07.160
"Hongyang's best food places?

03:07.200 --> 03:08.480
Just one tip.

03:08.520 --> 03:09.860
Hop on the bus Route 12,

03:09.900 --> 03:12.000
get on the metro, take the airport line,

03:12.040 --> 03:13.640
then get a ticket

03:13.680 --> 03:15.440
and fly to Guangzhou."

03:16.580 --> 03:18.060
Yu Qiao doesn't take you out

03:18.100 --> 03:19.340
to eat better stuff?

03:19.380 --> 03:21.300
If I wanted good food,
I wouldn't rely on him.

03:21.800 --> 03:22.800
Besides,

03:22.840 --> 03:24.560
his cafeteria's worse than ours.

03:31.660 --> 03:32.700
Slow down.

03:38.960 --> 03:40.180
Have you noticed?

03:41.680 --> 03:42.800
Everyone's staring at you.

03:44.340 --> 03:45.580
Big star.

03:50.760 --> 03:52.540
Big deal. So they looked at me.

03:55.840 --> 03:58.280
These guys at your university.

03:58.320 --> 03:59.840
None of them cares about appearances.

04:00.560 --> 04:01.620
None to clap my eyes on.

04:06.480 --> 04:07.320
You haven't told me

04:07.360 --> 04:08.860
why you came to Hongyang.

04:08.900 --> 04:10.100
Not even a heads-up.

04:10.140 --> 04:11.240
Is this a surprise for me?

04:14.380 --> 04:15.220
Really?

04:15.260 --> 04:17.680
Yeah right.
You think you're that important?

04:20.640 --> 04:21.480
So…

04:24.520 --> 04:25.380
you came to see Yu Qiao?

04:28.500 --> 04:29.780
What are you talking about?

04:29.820 --> 04:31.720
We're in college now. We've moved on.

04:32.960 --> 04:34.080
Then why are you here?

04:38.940 --> 04:40.980
Don't tell me you came all the way

04:41.020 --> 04:42.660
to Hongyang just to shop?

04:42.700 --> 04:44.100
Not just shopping.

04:44.140 --> 04:45.560
I'm restocking for my e-commerce store.

04:48.040 --> 04:48.900
Give me your bag.

04:49.440 --> 04:50.680
No thanks, I'll carry it.

04:50.720 --> 04:51.840
You're carrying too much.

04:51.880 --> 04:53.960
I'm not trying to help you carry it.

04:54.000 --> 04:56.020
I'm making the bag look fuller.

04:56.060 --> 04:57.000
The shop owners will think

04:57.040 --> 04:58.400
I'm a big buyer for bulk purchases.

04:58.900 --> 05:00.400
That way can I get more bargains.

05:03.800 --> 05:04.720
Also,

05:04.760 --> 05:06.600
if I don't get the price I want,

05:06.640 --> 05:08.520
I'll give you a signal,
then you drag me away.

05:08.560 --> 05:10.000
The seller'll definitely try to keep me.

05:11.540 --> 05:12.800
And if they don't?

05:13.580 --> 05:15.020
Trust me.

05:15.060 --> 05:16.340
I've been selling stuff for years.

05:16.380 --> 05:17.540
I know how this game works.

05:18.340 --> 05:19.400
Just count to ten.

05:19.440 --> 05:21.300
They'll stop us before you get to one.

05:24.000 --> 05:25.240
Fine.

05:25.280 --> 05:27.060
Excuse me, I'll take ten pieces.

05:27.100 --> 05:27.940
30 yuan, okay?

05:30.740 --> 05:32.520
Girl, why don't you ask for free, okay?

05:34.500 --> 05:36.220
Come on, I'm running an online shop.

05:36.880 --> 05:38.620
Let's just call this
a first-time connection.

05:38.660 --> 05:40.040
If my shop takes off,

05:40.080 --> 05:41.240
I'll be back often.

05:41.280 --> 05:42.140
It's a small business.

05:42.180 --> 05:43.280
I really can't go any lower.

05:45.040 --> 05:47.200
Seems a bit steep, Miss Qin.

05:47.240 --> 05:49.460
Should we check out someone else's booth?

05:49.960 --> 05:51.840
Might find a better deal.

05:51.880 --> 05:54.500
SMALL BUSINESS, NO HAGGLING
FROM 50 YUAN, NO REFUNDS OR EXCHANGES

05:56.340 --> 06:01.440
Ten, nine, eight, seven, six,

06:02.320 --> 06:08.140
five, four, three, two, one.

06:15.180 --> 06:19.900
Ten, nine, eight, seven, six…

06:23.480 --> 06:25.960
Ma'am, how about we try one more time?

06:26.740 --> 06:28.240
Ma'am, can you please

06:28.280 --> 06:29.840
lower the price a bit more?

06:29.880 --> 06:30.800
We're just

06:30.840 --> 06:31.740
starting out.

06:31.780 --> 06:33.100
It's not easy. Please?

06:33.920 --> 06:35.840
You're so pretty,

06:35.880 --> 06:37.520
and you've got such a kind heart.

06:38.040 --> 06:39.120
Tell you what,

06:39.680 --> 06:41.240
go get yourselves a couple cold drinks.

06:45.520 --> 06:46.880
Cheers.

06:51.940 --> 06:53.340
This isn't just soda.

06:54.040 --> 06:55.960
This is the sweet taste of victory.

06:56.000 --> 06:57.740
Your reward for helping me out.

06:57.780 --> 06:58.680
And you've got to

06:58.720 --> 06:59.920
carry that bag back for me.

07:04.280 --> 07:05.560
Let me call Yu Qiao then.

07:07.000 --> 07:08.780
Lin Yingtao, don't even
think about bailing.

07:09.940 --> 07:11.240
I'm not bailing.

07:11.800 --> 07:13.800
Since you're here,
the three of us should have dinner.

07:14.980 --> 07:16.820
I didn't come here to see him.

07:16.860 --> 07:17.820
I didn't tell him I came.

07:19.480 --> 07:20.320
Why not?

07:22.120 --> 07:23.140
Did you two fight?

07:24.600 --> 07:25.440
No.

07:26.040 --> 07:27.180
Then why avoid him?

07:28.460 --> 07:29.300
Because

07:30.400 --> 07:31.280
I'm seeing someone.

07:31.960 --> 07:32.860
Wait, what?

07:33.980 --> 07:35.140
When did that happen?

07:35.180 --> 07:36.920
Why didn't you tell me? Who is it?

07:37.760 --> 07:39.260
A few months ago.

07:39.860 --> 07:40.940
He's a classmate.

07:41.900 --> 07:43.840
Helped me a lot

07:43.880 --> 07:45.580
when I was starting the shop.

07:45.620 --> 07:47.620
We clicked. And it just kind of happened.

07:48.360 --> 07:49.540
He's nothing special.

07:50.180 --> 07:52.340
I didn't think it was worth mentioning.

07:52.880 --> 07:55.140
Not worth mentioning?

07:55.180 --> 07:56.260
It's your first relationship.

07:56.300 --> 07:57.200
That's huge.

07:57.240 --> 07:58.420
Can't believe you didn't tell me.

07:58.460 --> 07:59.300
That's so not cool.

07:59.340 --> 08:01.000
If I made a million,

08:01.040 --> 08:02.420
I'd tell you first thing.

08:02.460 --> 08:03.440
Now that's big news.

08:04.100 --> 08:05.240
Dating?

08:05.280 --> 08:06.240
Not a big deal.

08:06.280 --> 08:07.700
Just means there's a guy around

08:07.740 --> 08:09.200
who's a little more special

08:09.240 --> 08:10.720
than the rest.

08:11.900 --> 08:13.180
Is it really that simple?

08:14.420 --> 08:15.600
You want it to be complicated?

08:16.360 --> 08:18.440
Most people's relationships
start out just like that.

08:18.480 --> 08:19.760
It's only yours

08:19.800 --> 08:21.440
where the guy disappeared

08:21.480 --> 08:22.400
without a trace.

08:22.440 --> 08:23.320
Like smoke. Gone.

08:26.300 --> 08:27.440
Why are you bringing him up?

08:29.860 --> 08:30.760
Lin Yingtao,

08:32.400 --> 08:33.960
who's Jiang Qiaoxi?

08:34.000 --> 08:35.360
That name doesn't

08:35.400 --> 08:36.580
ring a single bell.

08:37.380 --> 08:38.919
Is he a figment of your imagination?

08:42.760 --> 08:43.600
Qin Yeyun,

08:44.680 --> 08:46.020
you're living proof

08:46.060 --> 08:47.340
that people never change.

08:48.380 --> 08:49.720
Same little devil as ever.

08:50.600 --> 08:52.240
Such a mean girl.

08:54.560 --> 08:55.940
- So mean.
- What is it?

08:55.980 --> 08:56.880
Look.

08:56.920 --> 08:57.760
Speak of the devil,

08:57.800 --> 08:58.680
Yu Qiao just texted me.

08:59.940 --> 09:01.220
What'd he say?

09:04.080 --> 09:04.980
Why are you so nervous?

09:06.540 --> 09:08.500
I'm only asking because
you look like something's up.

09:12.360 --> 09:13.400
He said he's got something

09:13.440 --> 09:14.320
for me.

09:14.360 --> 09:15.880
But he's being all formal

09:15.920 --> 09:18.120
- about it.
- Yingtao, I've got something for you.

09:18.160 --> 09:20.000
Are you free at five?

09:20.040 --> 09:21.200
Meet me at your campus gate.

09:21.240 --> 09:23.060
Well… then go.

09:23.100 --> 09:24.680
I'm not in a hurry.

09:24.720 --> 09:25.860
I'll help carry

09:25.900 --> 09:26.920
your stuff back first.

09:28.180 --> 09:30.060
It's just some clothes.
Not even that heavy.

09:30.100 --> 09:31.620
I'll grab a cab.

09:32.600 --> 09:34.540
I booked a room in the hotel
near your campus.

09:34.580 --> 09:36.540
You can swing by after.

09:36.580 --> 09:38.200
Why'd you get a hotel?

09:38.240 --> 09:39.580
Come back and stay with me.

09:40.280 --> 09:42.560
I'll talk to my roommates.
We'll just share my bed.

09:42.600 --> 09:44.220
They let friends do that all the time.

09:44.860 --> 09:45.700
Nah.

09:46.340 --> 09:47.940
I wanted to talk to you tonight.

09:47.980 --> 09:48.820
Easier to chat outside.

09:49.620 --> 09:50.800
Sure you don't wanna come?

09:50.840 --> 09:51.860
Save some money.

09:52.480 --> 09:53.700
Stop nagging.

09:53.740 --> 09:55.560
- Hurry up and go.
- You…

09:55.600 --> 09:56.700
Just go.

09:56.740 --> 09:57.660
Go on.

09:57.700 --> 09:59.240
Alright, I'll call you later.

09:59.280 --> 10:00.120
Okay.

10:03.860 --> 10:04.740
Go.

10:19.780 --> 10:20.780
Yu Qiao.

10:30.980 --> 10:32.100
What's this?

10:33.420 --> 10:34.420
Glad you got here in time.

10:35.240 --> 10:36.080
The cake hasn't melted.

10:36.120 --> 10:37.200
You messaged me

10:37.240 --> 10:38.080
just to give me cake?

10:39.180 --> 10:40.320
I saw

10:40.360 --> 10:41.660
this rabbit-shaped one.

10:41.700 --> 10:42.740
So I bought it for you.

10:47.180 --> 10:48.360
Seriously,

10:48.400 --> 10:49.920
you two are being so weird today.

10:49.960 --> 10:52.260
We two? Who is the other person?

10:58.300 --> 10:59.380
Just tell me.

11:00.220 --> 11:01.600
Did something happen?

11:07.060 --> 11:07.900
Yingtao,

11:08.640 --> 11:11.140
how much have you saved

11:12.220 --> 11:13.060
from tutoring?

11:17.260 --> 11:18.100
I knew it.

11:21.020 --> 11:22.360
You're here to borrow money.

11:23.920 --> 11:24.860
No wonder

11:24.900 --> 11:27.040
you wanted to meet up
and even brought me cake.

11:27.080 --> 11:28.440
Are you here to borrow money?

11:28.480 --> 11:30.980
- So will you lend it to me?
- Nope.

11:31.640 --> 11:33.820
We've known each other for years.

11:33.860 --> 11:35.200
Do you really have to be this cold?

11:35.240 --> 11:36.860
It's not cold.

11:36.900 --> 11:37.800
It's called having sense.

11:37.840 --> 11:39.760
Think about it.
If you needed serious money,

11:39.800 --> 11:40.960
you'd go to Auntie Zhang Ping,

11:41.000 --> 11:42.100
not me.

11:42.680 --> 11:43.940
And if it's not serious?

11:44.640 --> 11:45.860
Then I've got stuff to pay for.

11:46.480 --> 11:47.500
My money's not lying around.

11:48.600 --> 11:49.440
Right,

11:50.740 --> 11:52.100
you're saving up

11:52.140 --> 11:53.920
for plane tickets to every corner
of the globe.

11:54.700 --> 11:55.560
Big plans.

11:59.380 --> 12:01.160
Here. Take your cake.

12:05.240 --> 12:06.080
I'm heading off.

12:08.420 --> 12:09.640
Yu Qiao.

12:13.500 --> 12:14.460
If you really want

12:14.500 --> 12:15.680
a pair of Ray-Bans,

12:16.240 --> 12:17.240
no need to borrow from me.

12:19.000 --> 12:20.620
I'm going to Hong Kong this summer.

12:21.680 --> 12:22.540
I'll bring you a pair.

12:23.220 --> 12:24.080
For your birthday.

12:30.800 --> 12:32.800
You're going to Hong Kong?

12:35.860 --> 12:37.080
Do you know exactly where he is?

12:42.280 --> 12:43.220
No.

12:44.980 --> 12:45.820
But

12:46.600 --> 12:47.920
I've gotta try.

12:53.060 --> 12:53.940
Do you know

12:54.720 --> 12:55.980
which pair of Ray-Bans…

12:58.460 --> 12:59.560
I want?

13:02.580 --> 13:05.000
You've talked about them nonstop.
How could I not know?

13:05.040 --> 13:06.640
The ones from that poster in your room.

13:06.680 --> 13:07.700
The pilot ones.

13:09.660 --> 13:11.040
Then when I go somewhere,

13:12.280 --> 13:13.280
I'll bring you gifts too.

13:14.120 --> 13:15.000
Don't bother.

13:15.040 --> 13:16.220
You don't even know what I like.

13:18.480 --> 13:19.460
Of course I do.

13:39.140 --> 13:40.080
Hey.

13:42.340 --> 13:44.100
That looks heavy. Want a hand?

13:48.540 --> 13:50.140
No thanks, I'm good.

13:55.600 --> 13:56.980
Not sure what perfume that is,

13:57.740 --> 13:58.820
but it smells amazing.

14:06.800 --> 14:10.260
HAPPY STRAW HAT BAKERY

14:43.920 --> 14:46.240
Hi there, what can I get for you?

14:48.520 --> 14:50.520
You got any more of those bunny cakes?

14:50.560 --> 14:52.200
Just one small one left.

14:55.920 --> 14:57.880
Perfect. Wrap it up for me,

14:57.920 --> 14:58.780
thanks.

14:58.820 --> 14:59.820
Sure thing.

14:59.860 --> 15:01.220
Qin Yeyun!

15:02.780 --> 15:05.960
- Qin Yeyun!
- I heard you. Stop yelling already.

15:06.000 --> 15:07.940
SHANGKEYOU HOTEL, 348 XINHUA STREET

15:07.980 --> 15:08.820
Come on, let's go in.

15:15.660 --> 15:16.540
What?

15:20.860 --> 15:22.700
You are graduating in two years.

15:22.740 --> 15:24.120
What's that supposed to mean?

15:25.560 --> 15:26.720
You're acting way too chill.

15:28.660 --> 15:30.160
You didn't…

15:30.200 --> 15:31.160
Not what?

15:35.320 --> 15:36.900
No, nothing happened.

15:38.620 --> 15:39.520
Good.

15:40.520 --> 15:41.800
Don't look.

15:43.320 --> 15:46.120
But listen, if something does happen,

15:47.320 --> 15:48.380
you better tell me.

15:48.920 --> 15:50.040
No more keeping it to yourself

15:50.080 --> 15:51.280
like you did with your boyfriend.

15:52.280 --> 15:53.960
If you're not with me,

15:54.000 --> 15:55.660
you'll be the first person I call.

15:58.260 --> 15:59.160
Sure.

15:59.200 --> 16:00.580
And same goes for you.

16:00.620 --> 16:01.820
Wherever I am, call me.

16:24.660 --> 16:25.640
Slowly.

16:28.940 --> 16:29.980
Make a wish.

16:36.960 --> 16:37.960
Cheers.

16:44.440 --> 16:45.800
Let's do this.

16:45.840 --> 16:46.680
Open it.

16:55.560 --> 16:56.400
Seriously?

16:56.440 --> 16:57.280
In Hongyang,

16:57.320 --> 16:58.740
out of all the bakeries

16:58.780 --> 16:59.920
and all the cakes,

17:00.560 --> 17:01.520
you two managed to buy two cakes

17:01.560 --> 17:02.580
of the the exact same shape?

17:09.599 --> 17:10.599
I'll eat the one you got me.

17:18.240 --> 17:19.579
He came all this way

17:20.079 --> 17:21.359
just to give you a cake?

17:21.400 --> 17:23.099
That's what he said.

17:23.980 --> 17:26.260
But honestly, he was acting weird today.

17:26.300 --> 17:28.260
I actually thought he was
going to ask me for money.

17:28.300 --> 17:30.220
He's trying to get on your good side.

17:32.000 --> 17:33.580
I don't think so.

17:35.860 --> 17:36.700
Lin Yingtao,

17:36.740 --> 17:38.100
don't worry about me.

17:38.140 --> 17:39.420
I've got a boyfriend now.

17:40.160 --> 17:42.360
You think I'm the type
who'd date two people at once?

17:42.900 --> 17:44.240
Of course not.

17:44.780 --> 17:46.980
You're the most honest,
loyal, and decent person I know.

17:57.420 --> 17:58.300
Lin Yingtao,

17:58.860 --> 18:01.000
have you ever really
thought about your future?

18:01.040 --> 18:02.220
My future?

18:04.860 --> 18:06.300
Well…

18:08.360 --> 18:09.740
I want to be someone with dreams,

18:09.780 --> 18:11.800
ambition, and someone
who contributes to society.

18:14.040 --> 18:15.300
Why the deep question？

18:15.920 --> 18:18.180
Lately, when I'm running my shop

18:18.220 --> 18:19.540
or sorting out inventory,

18:20.560 --> 18:21.980
there are times I just want to give up.

18:25.840 --> 18:27.560
But whenever I get to that point,

18:27.600 --> 18:28.600
I try to imagine

18:29.340 --> 18:31.500
if I had a daughter one day,

18:31.540 --> 18:33.820
what kind of mom would she hope I'd be?

18:34.620 --> 18:36.220
She'd want me to be rich, ideally.

18:36.260 --> 18:37.460
Strong, too.

18:41.080 --> 18:43.240
So yeah, whenever I feel like
I can't go on,

18:44.000 --> 18:44.840
I just remind myself

18:46.520 --> 18:48.760
I want to be someone
my future daughter would be proud of.

18:49.840 --> 18:51.880
And that thought alone
gets me through anything.

19:02.300 --> 19:03.140
Yingtao,

19:03.900 --> 19:05.880
in that future you picture,

19:05.920 --> 19:07.420
does it have to be Jiang Qiaoxi?

19:09.560 --> 19:10.440
The same

19:11.160 --> 19:12.360
Jiang Qiaoxi

19:12.400 --> 19:13.560
who never tells you the truth,

19:14.400 --> 19:15.400
just leaves you

19:15.440 --> 19:16.780
with one perfect lie

19:16.820 --> 19:18.560
and vanishes without a trace?

19:21.560 --> 19:23.060
Why not Yu Qiao?

19:26.120 --> 19:27.280
What are you talking about?

19:29.800 --> 19:30.920
I've been here this whole time.

19:30.960 --> 19:31.980
No one sees you like I do.

19:32.520 --> 19:33.660
You only started sighing

19:33.700 --> 19:35.100
after you met Jiang Qiaoxi.

20:17.200 --> 20:18.380
I'm not

20:21.280 --> 20:22.900
as strong as you think.

20:24.820 --> 20:27.660
Sometimes I wish…

20:31.140 --> 20:33.240
I hadn't fallen for him.

20:34.080 --> 20:36.780
I wish I'd liked someone else instead.

20:39.880 --> 20:41.920
But that's where my thoughts stop.

20:44.400 --> 20:46.300
Because in the future I imagined,

20:47.620 --> 20:50.060
there just wasn't a version
without Jiang Qiaoxi in it.

20:59.140 --> 21:00.680
I told you before.

21:02.500 --> 21:04.120
Sometimes I feel like…

21:07.040 --> 21:09.620
he and I are the same person.

21:13.260 --> 21:15.320
So looking for him feels like

21:17.000 --> 21:18.620
reaching myself.

21:23.920 --> 21:24.760
Lin Yingtao,

21:25.440 --> 21:26.700
how are you two even alike?

21:27.340 --> 21:29.020
He's so selfish.

21:29.060 --> 21:30.360
He left you hanging for two years

21:30.400 --> 21:31.940
without a word.

21:35.100 --> 21:36.680
You weren't even officially dating.

21:45.560 --> 21:46.620
But every time

21:48.500 --> 21:51.080
I think about what he said
the night he left…

21:54.180 --> 21:55.760
The look on his face.

21:55.800 --> 21:56.760
The glint in his eyes.

21:59.080 --> 22:00.360
I can feel what he was feeling.

22:03.340 --> 22:05.140
If my pain right now

22:05.180 --> 22:06.800
is a ten, or a hundred,

22:07.840 --> 22:10.140
his must've been a thousand,
maybe ten thousand.

22:12.320 --> 22:13.580
I need to know

22:14.180 --> 22:16.040
what happened to Jiang Qiaoxi right after

22:16.080 --> 22:17.340
he finally got his freedom.

22:20.560 --> 22:22.480
It has nothing to do with
how he treated me.

22:24.100 --> 22:26.420
And it's not about

22:26.460 --> 22:28.120
whether we were a couple.

22:30.960 --> 22:32.200
He's just

22:32.240 --> 22:33.720
really important to me.

22:38.620 --> 22:39.460
Yingtao,

22:40.980 --> 22:42.120
you're such an idiot sometimes.

22:42.160 --> 22:43.500
How am I an idiot?

22:44.600 --> 22:46.560
I got a daughter before you did, didn't I?

22:47.820 --> 22:48.640
Jiang Chunlu.

23:02.340 --> 23:03.180
Cake time.

23:04.740 --> 23:05.580
Come on.

23:24.780 --> 23:26.060
Sure you don't want me to come?

23:26.100 --> 23:27.720
Can you carry all that by yourself?

23:27.760 --> 23:29.020
Relax.

23:29.660 --> 23:30.500
I've got it.

23:35.680 --> 23:36.840
Alright.

23:36.880 --> 23:38.340
I'm heading out.

23:40.500 --> 23:41.820
Text me when you get there,

23:41.860 --> 23:42.880
- so I know you're safe.
- Mm.

23:44.420 --> 23:45.300
Bye now.

23:49.160 --> 23:50.400
Wait, Yingtao.

23:51.700 --> 23:52.700
Having second thoughts?

23:56.480 --> 23:57.680
Actually,

23:58.620 --> 23:59.680
Jiang Qiaoxi…

24:01.700 --> 24:02.540
What about him?

24:10.440 --> 24:11.360
What is it?

24:12.300 --> 24:14.320
Okay, so these might not be fancy brands,

24:14.360 --> 24:15.820
but they're all really good.

24:15.860 --> 24:17.180
Maybe you should learn your makeups.

24:17.220 --> 24:18.860
Don’t let it be a situation that you look

24:18.900 --> 24:20.020
all worn out waiting for him.

24:24.300 --> 24:26.000
If you're giving all this to me,

24:26.040 --> 24:27.280
what are you gonna use?

24:27.320 --> 24:29.600
I bought these for you in the first place.

24:29.640 --> 24:30.920
Thought you might turn them down.

24:31.820 --> 24:32.800
Come on, pack them up.

24:34.140 --> 24:35.400
Throw them in your bag.

24:35.440 --> 24:36.700
Jeez.

24:45.640 --> 24:46.480
Thank you.

24:48.040 --> 24:49.160
Why are you even thanking me?

25:02.140 --> 25:03.540
Promise me you'll visit often.

25:03.580 --> 25:04.420
I will.

25:05.100 --> 25:06.220
I'm heading back.

25:10.440 --> 25:11.460
Take care, okay?

26:32.120 --> 26:34.240
Hey, fancy seeing you again.

26:35.360 --> 26:36.580
I'm not sure we know each other.

26:37.620 --> 26:38.480
I am not from your uni.

26:40.080 --> 26:41.960
Then what are you doing
at our basketball court?

26:43.980 --> 26:45.100
What,

26:45.140 --> 26:46.860
you guys charge admission
for basketball court?

26:48.260 --> 26:49.860
You here to check tickets?

26:53.120 --> 26:54.440
So you looking for someone?

26:55.200 --> 26:56.840
Who are you here for? Maybe I know them.

26:58.140 --> 26:59.760
You've got thousands of students.

26:59.800 --> 27:00.880
What are the odds?

27:03.520 --> 27:06.620
Wait… You're not here
to find your boyfriend, are you?

27:12.400 --> 27:13.480
I don't have a boyfriend.

27:14.020 --> 27:14.980
No way. For real?

27:15.020 --> 27:16.140
Why would I lie?

27:17.440 --> 27:19.240
Well, my lucks.

27:20.260 --> 27:21.420
I do like someone though.

27:26.520 --> 27:27.360
Oh, is that it?

27:29.380 --> 27:31.600
He used to play basketball all the time.

27:33.140 --> 27:35.420
Every time I passed the court,

27:36.300 --> 27:38.060
I'd glance over to see if he was there.

27:40.120 --> 27:41.140
Just one glance.

27:41.780 --> 27:42.980
But I never stopped walking.

27:44.300 --> 27:46.100
I didn't want him to know I was watching.

27:49.620 --> 27:50.780
Wouldn't it be better if he did?

27:52.340 --> 27:53.900
Most of us guys are out here playing

27:53.940 --> 27:55.980
just for the girls to watch.

27:58.060 --> 27:58.980
It wouldn't.

28:00.780 --> 28:02.300
Because the guy I like

28:02.340 --> 28:03.700
already likes someone else.

28:04.540 --> 28:06.580
And that someone is my best friend.

28:09.380 --> 28:11.580
Whoa, that's messy.

28:13.920 --> 28:15.260
That's not even the half of it.

28:16.920 --> 28:18.760
My best friend's crush

28:18.800 --> 28:19.820
suddenly vanished.

28:22.260 --> 28:23.100
But the thing is

28:23.760 --> 28:24.960
I know where he went.

28:26.220 --> 28:27.320
But I never told her.

28:30.060 --> 28:31.020
To get back at her?

28:32.000 --> 28:33.220
No, never.

28:36.440 --> 28:39.080
That guy keeps hurting her.

28:39.120 --> 28:41.120
I just didn't want her to hurt anymore.

28:42.860 --> 28:44.540
And I want my best friend

28:45.100 --> 28:47.040
to end up with the person I like.

28:47.860 --> 28:49.760
So I told her I was seeing someone.

28:51.760 --> 28:53.300
That way she wouldn't feel bad about me.

28:55.120 --> 28:56.000
But what about you?

28:56.680 --> 28:57.740
You keep looking out

28:58.400 --> 28:59.340
for everyone else.

29:00.500 --> 29:01.380
Doesn't it

29:02.400 --> 29:03.420
wear you down?

29:08.420 --> 29:10.020
Alright, let's drop it.

29:10.060 --> 29:11.920
I'm leaving. Bye.

29:14.700 --> 29:15.540
Hey, girl.

29:16.680 --> 29:17.840
The way you think about others

29:17.880 --> 29:18.720
like that

29:19.620 --> 29:20.660
is seriously impressive.

29:21.940 --> 29:23.140
You've got a heart of gold.

29:25.500 --> 29:26.740
Thanks.

29:26.780 --> 29:28.660
Thank you for saying that.
It makes me happy.

29:32.200 --> 29:35.160
Hi, I'm a friend of your tutor.

29:35.200 --> 29:36.200
Would it be okay

29:36.240 --> 29:37.200
if you shared

29:37.240 --> 29:38.460
his contact with me?

29:42.320 --> 29:44.060
Qiao, I'm taking my hairspray back.

29:45.840 --> 29:46.800
What now?

29:46.840 --> 29:47.840
Feeling yourself again?

29:48.340 --> 29:49.640
Not exactly.

29:51.220 --> 29:53.440
Met a girl today. Gorgeous.

29:53.480 --> 29:54.620
Totally love-struck.

29:54.660 --> 29:56.460
No idea what kind of guy she's into,

29:56.500 --> 29:57.580
but he's gotta be blind.

29:58.280 --> 29:59.680
She's stunning.

29:59.720 --> 30:01.100
How could he not like her?

30:02.380 --> 30:05.280
And what's that got to do
with you spraying hairspray?

30:05.880 --> 30:06.980
I was thinking,

30:07.560 --> 30:09.180
if I bump into her again,

30:09.220 --> 30:10.840
I wanna show up looking sharp.

30:15.640 --> 30:17.420
I can show you my ID.

30:17.460 --> 30:18.780
And if you're still unsure,

30:18.820 --> 30:19.880
we can meet up too.

30:20.420 --> 30:22.720
Am I seeing this right, Qiao?

30:23.280 --> 30:25.180
You're online-dating a girl
from Hong Kong?

30:26.100 --> 30:26.940
Yeah.

30:27.480 --> 30:29.320
As soon as my Exit-Entry Permit is ready,

30:29.360 --> 30:30.740
I'm going to see her.

30:32.720 --> 30:33.600
Qiao,

30:34.120 --> 30:35.400
you can't be serious.

30:35.440 --> 30:37.540
Aren't you afraid your miss
from Normal Uni will snap?

30:39.060 --> 30:39.940
She won't.

31:36.920 --> 31:38.380
This is my ID.

31:39.540 --> 31:41.060
This one's my Exit-Entry Permit.

31:41.660 --> 31:43.160
Here's my high school diploma.

31:43.200 --> 31:45.360
I graduated from
Jialin Experimental High School

31:45.400 --> 31:47.820
Yes. That's the same school
Mr. Jiang went to.

31:51.120 --> 31:52.900
And this is my university student ID.

31:52.940 --> 31:54.300
Northern Aviation University,

31:54.340 --> 31:55.500
Flight Academy.

31:55.540 --> 31:57.200
See the stamp? It's real.

31:57.240 --> 31:58.620
Flight Academy?

31:59.320 --> 32:01.820
So you're gonna be a pilot?

32:02.640 --> 32:03.680
That's the plan.

32:03.720 --> 32:04.600
You already told me

32:04.640 --> 32:05.520
all this when we were

32:05.560 --> 32:06.460
chatting on MSN.

32:06.960 --> 32:07.800
But

32:07.840 --> 32:09.060
you still haven't said

32:09.100 --> 32:10.600
why are you trying to find Mr. Jiang?

32:16.900 --> 32:17.760
He's my friend.

32:19.660 --> 32:20.980
And someone I like

32:22.000 --> 32:22.880
really cares about him.

32:27.340 --> 32:28.860
So I need to know where he is.

32:30.620 --> 32:32.640
Okay. Let me think.

32:36.260 --> 32:37.780
I know where Mr. Jiang lives,

32:38.740 --> 32:40.320
but my parents told me not to tell anyone.

32:44.260 --> 32:45.420
Still, I'll tell you.

32:47.880 --> 32:50.060
- Thanks.
- Not because you convinced me.

32:50.680 --> 32:52.020
I just think

32:52.060 --> 32:53.460
Mr. Jiang's pretty handsome.

32:54.420 --> 32:55.300
But

32:55.340 --> 32:56.960
every time he comes over for tutoring,

32:57.000 --> 32:58.260
he always looks kind of down.

32:58.940 --> 33:00.840
If he knew a friend

33:00.880 --> 33:02.060
was looking for him,

33:02.100 --> 33:03.080
he might cheer up a little.

33:06.480 --> 33:07.520
Why are you smiling?

33:07.560 --> 33:08.780
I was smiling because

33:10.140 --> 33:11.340
Jiang Qiaoxi's really lucky.

33:12.000 --> 33:13.540
Always got someone looking out for him.

33:19.340 --> 33:23.200
ROUTE 12A, CITYBUS

34:19.560 --> 34:23.380
WEST WING, FORTUNE MANSION

35:18.300 --> 35:23.180
ELEVATOR

36:12.960 --> 36:15.220
Who plays like that?

36:15.260 --> 36:17.820
You're unreal, man.

36:20.260 --> 36:21.580
- Whoa.
- That's crazy.

36:21.620 --> 36:25.500
Not you again! You've taken everything…

36:29.180 --> 36:30.720
…even my boxers.

36:33.520 --> 36:34.580
Still not done?

36:38.080 --> 36:39.000
I'm out.

36:42.700 --> 36:45.340
Useless. Didn't even back me up.

36:47.440 --> 36:48.280
Yu Qiao?

36:50.220 --> 36:51.060
What brings you here?

36:52.520 --> 36:53.400
Jiang Qiaoxi.

36:54.640 --> 36:56.520
- Your friend?
- Yeah.

36:57.780 --> 36:58.800
Pull up a chair then.

36:58.840 --> 36:59.780
He's not playing.

36:59.820 --> 37:00.880
Let's step outside.

37:04.880 --> 37:05.840
Looks like he's staying.

37:06.460 --> 37:07.500
Scoot over.

37:08.560 --> 37:09.720
Make room for him.

37:11.080 --> 37:12.620
Come on.

37:15.120 --> 37:16.420
Let's play.

37:16.460 --> 37:17.500
Let's start.

37:17.540 --> 37:19.020
Alright…

37:20.820 --> 37:22.080
No money,

37:23.420 --> 37:24.540
winner buys dinner.

37:25.780 --> 37:27.300
- Alright.
- Put it away.

37:35.520 --> 37:36.780
Okay.

37:43.440 --> 37:44.280
You go first.

37:45.820 --> 37:46.660
I'm in.

37:46.700 --> 37:47.600
Your turn.

37:49.320 --> 37:51.280
My turn.

37:52.880 --> 37:53.720
Call.

37:58.440 --> 37:59.340
Call.

38:08.200 --> 38:09.080
Call.

38:15.220 --> 38:16.060
Call.

38:16.600 --> 38:17.480
I'm folding.

38:24.360 --> 38:25.340
New guy.

38:29.180 --> 38:30.260
All in.

38:33.220 --> 38:34.480
Bold move.

38:41.760 --> 38:42.800
I'm out.

38:43.360 --> 38:44.360
I finally see you fold.

38:47.640 --> 38:49.120
Not bad.

38:53.280 --> 38:54.920
Dude, your friend's got your streak too.

38:54.960 --> 38:55.800
He bluffed you, man.

38:55.840 --> 38:57.960
I seriously thought he had a full house

38:58.000 --> 38:58.900
to go all in like that.

38:58.940 --> 39:00.720
Sneakier than you are.

39:01.360 --> 39:02.440
I wasn't bluffing.

39:03.240 --> 39:04.420
Never played play Texas Hold'em.

39:04.460 --> 39:06.800
Then why'd you go all in?

39:07.340 --> 39:08.220
Respect.

39:08.260 --> 39:09.440
Let's run it back.

39:11.320 --> 39:12.200
Next time.

39:12.240 --> 39:14.140
Hey, don't bail.

39:14.180 --> 39:16.820
- One more game.
- I said next time.

39:21.580 --> 39:22.420
Hot pot's calling.

39:23.680 --> 39:24.520
Don't be late.

39:42.200 --> 39:43.280
How'd you find me?

39:45.260 --> 39:46.520
That student you tutor?

39:47.140 --> 39:48.700
She took your photo and posted it.

39:48.740 --> 39:50.460
I recognized you.

39:55.620 --> 39:56.740
Does Yingtao know?

39:56.780 --> 39:58.300
If she did,

39:59.220 --> 40:01.080
you think I'd be the one here?

40:06.720 --> 40:07.860
So

40:07.900 --> 40:09.560
you ghosted everyone

40:09.600 --> 40:11.320
just to come hide out and play poker?

40:14.200 --> 40:15.300
Just killing time.

40:15.340 --> 40:16.240
Right.

40:17.040 --> 40:18.980
Mr. Math Genius.

40:19.020 --> 40:20.720
No one beats you

40:21.980 --> 40:23.140
at odds or strategy.

40:24.300 --> 40:25.500
You just did.

40:27.900 --> 40:29.880
Only because you folded too fast.

40:43.100 --> 40:44.160
So, how've you been?

40:46.060 --> 40:47.700
Cut it out.

40:48.260 --> 40:50.080
You want to know
how Yingtao's doing, don't you?

40:54.100 --> 40:54.940
She's not great.

40:56.200 --> 40:57.880
She pretends everything's normal,

40:58.620 --> 41:00.160
but she's been grinding hard.

41:00.200 --> 41:01.560
Tutoring nonstop,

41:01.600 --> 41:03.100
saving every penny.

41:03.140 --> 41:04.940
She says no matter where you are,

41:04.980 --> 41:06.100
she will find you.

41:07.800 --> 41:08.700
I know.

41:10.860 --> 41:11.700
She…

41:14.980 --> 41:16.100
She keeps messaging me.

41:17.500 --> 41:18.700
I'm scared she'll call,

41:19.420 --> 41:20.400
so

41:20.440 --> 41:21.640
I usually turn off my phone.

41:22.460 --> 41:24.040
Only around four or five in the morning

41:24.760 --> 41:25.660
do I turn it on

41:27.060 --> 41:28.340
to check if she wrote anything.

41:28.380 --> 41:30.020
And you think showing me your soft side

41:31.480 --> 41:32.560
is going to change anything?

41:33.400 --> 41:35.160
Why haven't you told Yingtao?

41:35.200 --> 41:36.040
You know

41:36.080 --> 41:37.660
if you just sent her one message,

41:37.700 --> 41:38.880
she'd feel so much better.

41:38.920 --> 41:40.080
You've seen it for yourself.

41:41.100 --> 41:42.520
Look at me.

41:43.600 --> 41:45.000
Look at how I'm living right now.

41:45.040 --> 41:45.940
Am I in any position

41:45.980 --> 41:47.080
to be with Yingtao?

41:47.120 --> 41:48.360
What are you talking about?

41:48.400 --> 41:50.060
You missing an arm? Missing a leg?

41:50.100 --> 41:51.280
What kind of life are you living?

41:51.320 --> 41:53.040
Are you starving? Homeless?

41:56.260 --> 41:57.220
Not that bad.

41:58.800 --> 41:59.880
But it's not great either.

42:00.540 --> 42:01.420
Jiang Qiaoxi,

42:02.280 --> 42:03.640
what's really going on?

42:09.820 --> 42:11.300
If you don't say, I won't ask.

42:18.000 --> 42:19.100
But you seriously think

42:19.140 --> 42:21.340
You think the way you are now
is the reason between you two?

42:25.660 --> 42:26.540
It is me…

42:29.500 --> 42:31.180
I am the reason between us.

44:51.720 --> 44:54.640
Subtitle translation by: Jiaxin Wang
